{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09397","headline":"郡内闲居 · 韦应物","name":"郡内闲居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"栖息绝尘侣，孱钝得自怡。\n腰悬竹使符，心与庐山缁。\n永日一酣寝，起坐兀无思。\n长廊独看雨，衆药发幽姿。\n今夕已云罢，明晨复如斯。\n何事能爲累，宠辱岂要辞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09397.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09397","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}